{
	"repoName": "fpp-ExternalFPP",
	"name": "External FPP Web Access",
	"author": "jessica12ryan",
	"description": "Opens an additional TCP port on your FPP that serves the FPP web UI behind a customizable login page (username and password). Uses FPP's built-in Apache web server as a reverse proxy, so no extra packages are required. Ideal for safely exposing the FPP UI to guest or remote networks without touching the normal local UI.",
